usage: c360.py [-h]
               {prepare,load,query,compare,export-features,validate-results} ...

Customer 360 database coursework

positional arguments:
  {prepare,load,query,compare,export-features,validate-results}
    prepare             Validate original Olist CSVs and prepare a shared
                        snapshot
    load                Initialize and load an immutable snapshot
    query               Execute a business query or constraint audit
    export-features     Export a retrospective feature contract; no mining
    validate-results    Check a separate course's annotations; no database
                        writes

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
